{"id":"00228","root":"uni00228_1","name":{"ja":"磯咲　伊織","en":"Isozaki Iori"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"磯咲　伊織","en":"Isozaki Iori"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-08-16","limited":false,"characterId":169,"profile":{"ja":"ふうまのクラスメイトである磯咲伊紀の妹。直接の面識はないが、ふうまは彼女の存在を知っている。対魔忍としての力はまだまだであるが、底抜けな元気の良さで明るいムードを作り上げ、皆に活力を与える才能は、井河さくらに匹敵すると言われるほど。授業中もその賑やかさは絶えることなく、教師に怒られても、あまり気にしていない感じであるが、陰では１人で絶え間ない訓練をしている。未熟ながら、対魔忍として低級魔族退治や人命救助の任務に出撃していくこともあり、一歩づつ実力をつけている。いち早く前線にて活躍し皆の期待に応えられればと考えている。体型に関しては発達のいい女子を羨ましく思い、胸のマッサージと牛乳を飲むのが日課。彼女の家は水遁の術を使う一族だが、今はまだ弱い技しか扱うことができず、それを補う為にと剣術も身に着けている。流派は僅かな門下生しか取らない真剣流（しんけんりゅう）。","en":"Isozaki Iori is the younger sister of Isozaki Inori, a classmate of Fuuma. Although she has never met Fuuma directly, Fuuma knows of her existence. Her abilities as a Taimanin are still developing, but her boundless energy creates a bright atmosphere that energizes everyone, a talent said to rival Igawa Sakura's. Her lively chatter never ceases even during lessons; she brushes off teachers' scoldings and trains relentlessly on her own in secret. Though still inexperienced, she has been dispatched on missions to eliminate low-rank demons and rescue civilians, steadily improving step by step. She aspires to shine on the front lines and live up to everyone's expectations. Envious of well-developed girls, she makes daily chest massages and drinks milk. Her family practices water-style ninjutsu, but she can only use weak techniques for now, so she also studies swordsmanship to compensate. She follows the Shin-ken style, a school that accepts only a handful of disciples."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00228_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[770,1540],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[119,238],"def":[94,188],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","280009"]},{"id":"uni00228_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1